WEBVTT

00:01:29.893 --> 00:01:31.226
(Laughter)

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.419
No.

00:01:32.443 --> 00:01:36.222
(Applause)

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:39.732
Populists are no easy target for satire

00:01:39.756 --> 00:01:42.280
because you try to nail them down one day,

00:01:42.304 --> 00:01:43.921
and the next day, they outdo you.

00:01:43.945 --> 00:01:47.331
For example, as soon as he was elected,

00:01:47.355 --> 00:01:51.495
I tried to imagine the tweet
that Trump would send on Christmas Eve.

00:01:51.519 --> 00:01:53.599
So I did this, OK?

00:01:53.623 --> 00:01:56.790
[Merry Christmas to all!
Except all those pathetic losers. So sad.]

00:01:56.814 --> 00:01:58.600
(Laughter)

00:01:58.624 --> 00:02:01.204
And basically, the next day,
Trump tweeted this: